@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundcolor white
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title UML Sequence Diagram – Main System Workflow\nBlockchain-Enabled IoT System for Produce Traceability and Cold Chain Monitoring

actor "Supply Chain Operator" as Operator
participant "Web Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Backend System" as Backend
participant "IoT Device (ESP32 + DHT22)" as IoT
database "Database" as DB
participant "Blockchain Network" as Blockchain

== 1. LOGIN ==
Operator -> Dashboard: Enter login credentials
Dashboard -> Backend: Submit credentials
Backend -> DB: Verify user credentials
DB --> Backend: Authentication result
Backend --> Dashboard: Login result
Dashboard --> Operator: Display dashboard

alt Invalid credentials
    Backend --> Dashboard: Display login error
    Dashboard --> Operator: Login failed
end

== 2. PRODUCE BATCH REGISTRATION ==
Operator -> Dashboard: Enter produce batch details
Dashboard -> Backend: Submit batch details
Backend -> DB: Store produce batch
DB --> Backend: Return batch ID
Backend --> Dashboard: Generate/display batch QR code
Dashboard --> Operator: Display QR code

== 3. IoT ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING ==
IoT -> Backend: Send temperature and humidity reading\n(Temperature, Humidity, Timestamp, Device ID, Batch ID)
Backend -> DB: Store environmental reading
DB --> Backend: Confirm stored reading
Backend -> Backend: Evaluate temperature/humidity thresholds

== 4. ENVIRONMENTAL ALERT ==
alt Threshold exceeded
    Backend -> DB: Record environmental alert/event
    Backend -> Dashboard: Send environmental alert
    Dashboard -> Operator: Display alert
else Within threshold
    Backend -> Backend: Continue monitoring
end

== 5. COLD-CHAIN / TRACEABILITY EVENT ==
Operator -> Dashboard: Record cold-chain event or produce movement
Dashboard -> Backend: Submit event details
Backend -> DB: Store event and movement record
DB --> Backend: Confirm record

== 6. BLOCKCHAIN RECORD ==
Backend -> Blockchain: Submit critical event/hash
Blockchain --> Backend: Return transaction confirmation/reference
Backend -> DB: Store blockchain reference

== 7. VIEW MONITORING AND TRACEABILITY INFORMATION ==
Operator -> Dashboard: Request monitoring/traceability information
Dashboard -> Backend: Request records
Backend -> DB: Retrieve environmental, batch and traceability records
DB --> Backend: Return records
Backend --> Dashboard: Return monitoring and traceability information
Dashboard --> Operator: Display dashboard and traceability information

caption Figure 6: UML Sequence Diagram – Main System Workflow
@enduml
